# .agentignore — file-level access restrictions for this project.
# The agent treats every pattern here exactly like the hardcoded patterns in
# global/AGENTS.md "Access Restrictions": never read/access without explicit
# user confirmation. Enforced mechanically by scripts/dod.sh (staged files
# are checked against this list before every commit — see Step 8).
#
# NOTE: this is FILE-LEVEL only. It does NOT block field-level API reads
# (e.g. a Directus MCP call reading a PII field from an allowed collection).
# Field-level protection requires a dedicated MCP interceptor — see
# notes/Harness/v0.4 - SANDBOX_ARCHITECTURE.md for that (unbuilt) design.

# Production environment
.env.production
docker-compose.prod.yml

# Backups and dumps
backups/
dumps/
*.sql.gz

# Private keys
*.pem
*.key
